        <mxCell id="g6note" parent="g6" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5A6C86;spacing=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;AdCP tools&lt;/b&gt; — Ad Context Protocol: get_products, create_media_buy, get_media_buy_delivery, get_signals, activate_signal (served from bundled synthetic ecosystem data).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;agents-as-tools&lt;/b&gt; — exposes the fleet itself over MCP: list_agents, get_agent_schema, invoke_agent, for external MCP clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;audience taxonomy&lt;/b&gt; — taxonomy search and TQL predicate build / validate / count." vertex="1">
