        <mxCell id="g7note" parent="g7" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5A6C86;spacing=2;" value="The agent tool returns immediately: the request Lambda writes a pending row and fires the processor asynchronously. The processor calls the Bedrock image model, stores the PNG, and flips the job row to complete; the UI gallery then reads it with a presigned URL." vertex="1">
